                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Glad to see @JudiciaryGOP approve my bill, the Tribal Firearms Access Act to safeguard the right to bear arms in Indian Country. We're one step closer to protecting Tribal members' ability to freely exercise their #2A rights. https://t.co/EGQPO3VfLq",
